      en: ["Features a marine protected area", "Important for canoeing traditions", "Over 1,000 residents", "Significant paramount chief seat"],
      es: ["Posee una reserva marina", "Importante para la tradición de canoas", "Más de 1.000 habitantes", "Sede importante de jefatura"],
